	"description": "Multiplane DOF (ADR-0027) tabletop/macro look. The newspaper title card sits tack-sharp on the focal plane (z 0.0) while a procedural defocused-material backdrop fills the frame behind it: a soft warm surface that loses detail and gains bright bokeh specks toward the edges (defocused highlights receding into depth), plus a vignette. The card's drop shadow falls onto the backdrop, so it reads as a real newspaper lying on a textured surface shot with a shallow macro lens \u2014 edge blur + depth, almost 3D. The washi-tape sits at z 0.0 too, sharp with the card.",
